  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>By pushing your heart into your magic you produce wonderful effects.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may replace a spell’s normal damage type with love damage (see the <a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/dynamic-warrior\">dynamic warrior's</a> entry). Any variables of the spell dependent on Intelligence or Wisdom modifier are instead made to be dependent on Charisma. Creatures damaged by this spell receive a Will save to halve the damage, as normal for love damage. If the spell allows for a Fortitude or Reflex save for partial effect, this Will save replaces that save. This feat has no effect on spells that deal no damage</p>\n<p><strong>Level Increase:</strong> +3 (an Impassioned spell uses up a spell slot three levels higher than the spell’s actual level.)</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/gonzo-feats#toc54\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
